    <string name="about_text">Translated with Google

Machine translation. Not official.

Machine translation on-device with Google ML Kit. Accuracy is not guaranteed.
Not an official or human translation.</string>
    <string name="terms_draft">TERMS OF USE - DRAFT - DEVELOPER REVIEW REQUIRED. This app reads EPUB files chosen on the device. There is no book catalog and no distribution of books or translations. Use only files you have the legal right to use. Translation is on-device machine translation for personal on-screen display only and is not an official edition. Do not share, export, publish, or distribute translated text. Sharing, where available, is limited to the original imported file. You are responsible for the files you open. Translation quality is not guaranteed.</string>
    <string name="privacy_draft">PRIVACY POLICY - DRAFT. Translation runs on-device with Google ML Kit. Book text is not uploaded to the developer server for translation. ML Kit may send performance or usage metrics to Google, not book content to the developer. Books and translations stay on the device. Android share sends a file only to the destination you choose.</string>
